st to pick berries, whereupon they stumble upon an injured knight from the Capital, later recognized as Henry Leobolt. Although Al wants to return to get medicine, Rin decides to treat Henry with the Song of Healing. After Henry formally introduces himself and tries to honor their wish of going to the Capital, ice mysteriously begins to spread throughout the forest, separating Rin and Al from Henry.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nzfFuAgpUBbBVxWp1GgDDX0Zb2o.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"A young girl named Rin lives with her younger brother Al, older sister Mel and grandfather Talgia Hawkray in the faraway Dandera Village deep within a forest. Rin is devoted to go to the Capital and sing in the Court Orchestra, while Al is determined to show off his prototype inventions. However, Talgia refuses and even forbids Rin from singing. Rin and Al are given the opportunity to sneak out by venturing into the forest to pick berries, whereupon they stumble upon an injured knight from the Capital, later recognized as Henry Leobolt. Although Al wants to return to get medicine, Rin decides to treat Henry with the Song of Healing. After Henry formally introduces himself and tries to honor their wish of going to the Capital, ice mysteriously begins to spread throughout the forest, separating Rin and Al from Henry.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nzfFuAgpUBbBVxWp1GgDDX0Zb2o.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12523","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98073","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34338","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78375","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"341395","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"24417","synopsis":"Henry returns to the Capital, only to be told that a war is upon the country in its competition for the power of their songstress, later recognized as Finis, whose songs can rejuvenate and heal soldiers. Henry refuses to see Finis as a tool to be used in war. Finis, a beautiful but clumsy woman, is forbidden to leave the palace tower, according to her maid Corte. The ruthless prince Rudo Bernstein IV intends to marry Finis and keep her bound to the castle. While Finis enjoys fresh air in the garden on a rare occasion with her attendants, she gets lost and almost killed by an assassin. Henry arrives to save her and earns the title of being her bodyguard.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xVfUXPjVJc6HDoutSRVOu6wnCaR.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Henry returns to the Capital, only to be told that a war is upon the country in its competition for the power of their songstress, later recognized as Finis, whose songs can rejuvenate and heal soldiers. Henry refuses to see Finis as a tool to be used in war. Finis, a beautiful but clumsy woman, is forbidden to leave the palace tower, according to her maid Corte. The ruthless prince Rudo Bernstein IV intends to marry Finis and keep her bound to the castle. While Finis enjoys fresh air in the garden on a rare occasion with her attendants, she gets lost and almost killed by an assassin. Henry arrives to save her and earns the title of being her bodyguard.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xVfUXPjVJc6HDoutSRVOu6wnCaR.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12523","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98073","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34338","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78375","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"341395","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"24418","synopsis":"The innkeepers sell out Rin, Al and Pony to some knights of the Capital Army. Pony attempts to stall them, but she is knocked out. Al then throws a Star Bomb, a type of firecracker bomb invention that can act as a smoke screen. However, Al gets stabbed by a dagger in the process, and Rin uses the Song of Healing to treat him. The knights promptly capture Rin, Al and Pony on boats. Al uses a knife to saw through his ropes before untying Rin and Pony. Also, Pony teaches Rin the Song of Wind. With Al's Star Bombs and then Rin's Song of Wind, the knights are successfully defeated.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/asheBROYjTH0TU3ZS2msbqoa2GH.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"The innkeepers sell out Rin, Al and Pony to some knights of the Capital Army. Pony attempts to stall them, but she is knocked out. Al then throws a Star Bomb, a type of firecracker bomb invention that can act as a smoke screen. However, Al gets stabbed by a dagger in the process, and Rin uses the Song of Healing to treat him. The knights promptly capture Rin, Al and Pony on boats. Al uses a knife to saw through his ropes before untying Rin and Pony. Also, Pony teaches Rin the Song of Wind. With Al's Star Bombs and then Rin's Song of Wind, the knights are successfully defeated.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/asheBROYjTH0TU3ZS2msbqoa2GH.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12523","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98073","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34338","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78375","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"341395","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"24419","synopsis":"Henry fights in the front lines alongside comrades Berrow and Snore. Finis later arrives on the front lines and put her life in danger to use her Song of Healing in order to revive the soldiers. Henry then hears word that Finis plans to use the destructive Weapon of Song against the enemy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nBSVMY7nRGJ0GNQbZq9PRtNaFCK.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Henry fights in the front lines alongside comrades Berrow and Snore. Finis later arrives on the front lines and put her life in danger to use her Song of Healing in order to revive the soldiers. Henry then hears word that Finis plans to use the destructive Weapon of Song against the enemy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nBSVMY7nRGJ0GNQbZq9PRtNaFCK.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12523","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98073","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34338","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78375","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"341395","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"24427","synopsis":"Corte realizes that a frail Finis is using her powers for war to protect Henry. Being told that Rudo would execute Henry if Finis did not use her powers against the enemy, Corte runs into the forest to gather herbs. When a knight tells Corte that Finis has gone to the watering hole, Corte instinctively runs back into the forest.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hxGL2kCD8IAtrXXNWet0PzkDscC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Corte realizes that a frail Finis is using her powers for war to protect Henry. Being told that Rudo would execute Henry if Finis did not use her powers against the enemy, Corte runs into the forest to gather herbs. When a knight tells Corte that Finis has gone to the watering hole, Corte instinctively runs back into the forest.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hxGL2kCD8IAtrXXNWet0PzkDscC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12523","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98073","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34338","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78375","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"341395","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"24425","synopsis":"Henry reunites with Finis, Berrow and Snore in the forest. Although Corte is relieved to find them, Rudo arrives to take Finis to the Montvale Fortress, but Henry proposes that it can be captured without the use of Finis. Henry, Berrow and Snore ultimately conquers the Montvale Fortress. Meanwhile, Rin, Al, Pony, Monica and Allu find a cottage owned by Doctor Weissen, who has all sorts of contraptions.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xWsK4KLNkSsnHyj2Sekpnp3e8Tr.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Henry reunites with Finis, Berrow and Snore in the forest. Although Corte is relieved to find them, Rudo arrives to take Finis to the Montvale Fortress, but Henry proposes that it can be captured without the use of Finis. Henry, Berrow and Snore ultimately conquers the Montvale Fortress. Meanwhile, Rin, Al, Pony, Monica and Allu find a cottage owned by Doctor Weissen, who has all sorts of contraptions.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xWsK4KLNkSsnHyj2Sekpnp3e8Tr.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12523","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98073","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34338","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78375","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"341395","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"24424","synopsis":"While the front line knights celebrate with a banquet in honor of their victory at their army camp, Corte sternly warns Finis and Henry to run away.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fJ9PvkDVEAsXC8FmNmrZKgaB7XB.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"While the front line knights celebrate with a banquet in honor of their victory at their army camp, Corte sternly warns Finis and Henry to run away.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fJ9PvkDVEAsXC8FmNmrZKgaB7XB.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12523","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98073","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34338","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78375","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"341395","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"24423","synopsis":"In an alternate timeline, astronomer Henry predicts that the Moon has changed its orbit and will collide into Earth in about 60,000 years. When Henry and Finis meet, she tells him that she is a songstress who was blessed with the power to make miracles, until she used that power to kill her dearly beloved. According to her, life is an endless yet hopeless cycle between past and future","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eGxyYoHDz7WwLGgKnveTU7T2SLa.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"In an alternate timeline, astronomer Henry predicts that the Moon has changed its orbit and will collide into Earth in about 60,000 years. When Henry and Finis meet, she tells him that she is a songstress who was blessed with the power to make miracles, until she used that power to kill her dearly beloved. According to her, life is an endless yet hopeless cycle between past and future","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eGxyYoHDz7WwLGgKnveTU7T2SLa.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12523","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98073","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34338","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"78375","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"341395","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"24420","synopsis":"Finis, now in cloaked attire, is told by Bazra that her power of songs will achieve world domination, but she states that their prior agreement was for her to sing her Song of Mortality during the Starsong Festival. Rin, Pony, Monica and Allu realize that Finis has only been seen by a few knights of the Capital Army.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Fn5UWb4QQjLePE1eGejp9WWor5.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Finis, now in cloaked attire, is told by Bazra that her power of songs will achieve world domination, but she states that their prior agreement was for her to sing her Song of Mortality during the Starsong Festival. Rin, Pony, Monica and Allu realize that Finis has only been seen by a few knights of the Capital Army.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Fn5UWb4QQjLePE1eGejp9WWor5.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12523","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider